WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.300
La wĩntoog sẽn vẽege, gɩdg n waa ne rũms nins a sẽn bool tɩ b wa rɩ wã fãa.

00:00:06.380 --> 00:00:09.448
La b yãame t'a zugã la a pʋgã gãname.

00:00:09.528 --> 00:00:13.106
Rẽ n so t'a sẽn yaa gãandã yaa nin-kãsenga.

00:00:13.186 --> 00:00:17.615
B sẽn wa n na n kʋɩɩb-a wã, b na n yɩɩga ne sũ-noogo.

00:00:17.695 --> 00:00:28.674
A ra gũuda rasem wʋsgo, a maag sẽn ka tarẽ, n yaool n pa tõe n yi ye, t'a na n dɩka rɩɩb nins sẽn ketã ne neb nins komã sẽn yã wã.

00:00:28.754 --> 00:00:36.926
La b yetame tɩ hal b daarã tɛka, ra-kãnga kẽnda ne a meng n pa mi b sẽn tõe n maan bũmb ninsã ye.
